{
  "slug": "codeqr",
  "name": "Codeqr",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "CodeQR plugin for creating short links, generating QR codes, tracking analytics, managing domains and tags, and tracking conversions. Integrates the CodeQR API directly into Claude Code and Cowork via MCP server and Agent Skills.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `analytics` (Query CodeQR analytics data), `create-link` (Create shortened links with CodeQR), `create-qrcode` (Generate QR codes with CodeQR), `manage-domains` (Manage custom domains in CodeQR), `manage-links` (Manage existing CodeQR short links), `manage-tags` (Manage tags in CodeQR for organizing links), `track-conversions` (Track leads and sales conversions in CodeQR)\n- **Commands** (1): `codeqr` (Quick access to CodeQR operations — create links, generate QR codes, and check analytics)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `codeqr`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codeqr@claude-community` from `codeqr-io/codeqr-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
